    "body": "We need to update the styling of the new Palette component in `modules/masonry/src/components/Palette/`. This is how it currently looks like:\n\n<img width=\"166\" height=\"632\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0c2d1b75-26ee-417a-b675-5c6e31413a6c\" />\n\nObjectives:\n- [ ] Use tailwind sans font throughout.\n- [ ] The sidebar visually looks too wide — it would be nice to cut down few pixels if possible. Set font size to size xs. Reduce the sidebar horizontal padding a little bit.\n- [ ] The Brick wrappers have a an unnecessary padding which causes them to be misaligned with the section heading.\n- [ ] Make sure all borders use the tailwind default border color.\n- [ ] Reduce the padding from the Brick list. Reduce the search bar container padding to align.\n- [ ] Use different shades for hover/focus states and active state for the tabs.\n- [ ] The tab and section buttons both seem to be moving when clicked; modify to remove movement.\n- [ ] Remove extra padding at the bottom of the Brick list. Match with top padding.\n- [ ] Replace search box placeholder text to just say \"Search\".\n",
